<div class="card"><h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">情绪先行指标 · 近20日 <span class="hint">(脚本段A档 · 情绪先行指标.py --card · 当日温度 16.6·冰点)</span></h3><p class="mut" style="margin:0 0 6px">口径: THS 涨停池(无ST) · 晋级率基准=THS 最近前一交易日(未记录基准日) · 与梯队卡 zt_pool 全口径并存为体系既有设计</p><svg viewBox="0 0 880 196" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block"><line x1="46" y1="172" x2="866" y2="172" stroke="#3a3f46"/><line x1="46" y1="112.5" x2="866" y2="112.5" stroke="#8a6d2f" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="866" y="109.5" font-size="8.5" fill="#8a6d2f" text-anchor="end">1进2率10%=接力冰点参考线</text><rect x="50.0" y="70.0" width="21.3" height="102.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="60.6" y="67.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">51</text><rect x="79.3" y="70.0" width="21.3" height="102.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="90.0" y="67.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">51</text><rect x="108.6" y="169.0" width="21.3" height="3.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="119.2" y="166.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">0</text><rect x="137.9" y="106.0" width="21.3" height="66.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="148.6" y="103.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">33</text><rect x="167.2" y="60.0" width="21.3" height="112.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="177.8" y="57.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">56</text><rect x="196.5" y="68.0" width="21.3" height="104.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="207.2" y="65.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">52</text><rect x="225.8" y="88.0" width="21.3" height="84.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="236.5" y="85.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">42</text><rect x="255.1" y="34.0" width="21.3" height="138.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="265.8" y="31.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">69</text><rect x="284.4" y="80.0" width="21.3" height="92.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="295.0" y="77.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">46</text><rect x="313.7" y="38.0" width="21.3" height="134.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="324.3" y="35.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">67</text><rect x="343.0" y="100.0" width="21.3" height="72.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="353.6" y="97.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">36</text><rect x="372.3" y="100.0" width="21.3" height="72.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="382.9" y="97.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">36</text><rect x="401.6" y="54.0" width="21.3" height="118.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="412.2" y="51.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">59</text><rect x="430.9" y="80.0" width="21.3" height="92.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="441.6" y="77.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">46</text><rect x="460.2" y="64.0" width="21.3" height="108.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="470.8" y="61.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">54</text><rect x="489.5" y="72.0" width="21.3" height="100.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="500.1" y="69.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">50</text><rect x="518.8" y="106.0" width="21.3" height="66.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="529.4" y="103.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">33</text><rect x="548.1" y="8.0" width="21.3" height="164.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="558.8" y="5.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">82</text><rect x="577.4" y="62.0" width="21.3" height="110.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="588.0" y="59.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">55</text><rect x="606.7" y="90.0" width="21.3" height="82.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"/><text x="617.4" y="87.0" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">41</text></svg><table class="p2"><tr><th class="l">指标</th><th>口径</th><th>读数</th></tr><tr><td class="l">晋级</td><td>涨停数_净 41 · 首板29 / 二连板8 / 三连板0</td><td>1进2率 20.0% · 2进3率 0.0% · 高度晋级率 26.7%</td></tr>
