<div class="card"><h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">连板梯队 <span class="hint">机器核对 · 涨停池连板数分布(涨停池 41 只(zt_pool全口径,含ST))</span></h3><div class="cols"><div class="col hotc"><i style="height:4%"></i><b>1</b><span>5板</span></div>
