<!--MACHVOTE--><div style="margin:10px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#14171e;border:1px solid #2a2f3a;border-radius:10px">
<div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#d9a441;font-family:monospace">五路周期投票 · 主判=退潮·升</div>
